{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/spine
    A book on the shelf: its spine, as tall and thick as the book, in the colour of its cover, with its label at the foot.
    A book that is out leaves its gap, with the bird that took it. Without the script, it is a link to its record; with
    it, it comes out onto the lectern. It goes inside its slot, a li that whoever includes it writes (as stacks and record do).
    Context variables required for this template:
    * id, url, title, shown (the title as it fits), authors, callnumber, place, label (what a screen reader hears)
    * cm, width, background, dark - its size and colours
    * ink - cream or ink, the colour of its letters
    * small, topdown, band, out, held, consult, here - how it looks
    * lines - the lines of its label; joined - the same, joined with |
    * placecolour - the colour of its place, when the place is a colour
    * cover, state, statetext - for the lectern; awaytext - what the gap of a book that is out says
    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 7, "url": "#", "title": "El dragón que leía", "shown": "El dragón que leía", "authors": "Ana Montes",
        "callnumber": "82-3 MON dra", "place": "Rojo", "label": "El dragón que leía, Ana Montes, 82-3 MON dra",
        "cm": 22, "width": 34, "background": "#2c7a6a", "dark": "#246a5c", "ink": "cream", "small": false,
        "topdown": false, "band": "", "out": false, "held": false, "consult": false, "here": false,
        "lines": [{"line": "82-3"}, {"line": "MON"}, {"line": "dra"}], "joined": "82-3|MON|dra", "placecolour": "#d63a2f", "cover": null,
        "state": "free", "statetext": "Libre", "awaytext": ""
    }
}}
<a class="ayv-spine ayv-spine-{{ink}}{{#small}} ayv-spine-small{{/small}}{{#topdown}} ayv-spine-topdown{{/topdown}} {{band}}" href="{{url}}" title="{{title}}"
        style="--bg: {{background}}; --bgd: {{dark}}{{#placecolour}}; --place: {{placecolour}}{{/placecolour}}"
        data-id="{{id}}" data-title="{{title}}" data-authors="{{authors}}" data-call="{{callnumber}}" data-lines="{{joined}}"
        data-place="{{place}}" data-state="{{state}}" data-statetext="{{statetext}}"{{#cover}} data-cover="{{cover}}"{{/cover}}{{#here}} aria-current="true"{{/here}}>
        <span class="ayv-sr">{{label}}</span>
        {{#out}}
        <span class="ayv-spine-bird" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ayv-spine-away" aria-hidden="true">{{awaytext}}</span>
        {{/out}}
        {{^out}}
        <span class="ayv-spine-title" aria-hidden="true">{{shown}}</span>
        <span class="ayv-spine-label{{#placecolour}} ayv-spine-label-place{{/placecolour}}" aria-hidden="true">{{#lines}}<span>{{line}}</span>{{/lines}}</span>
        {{#consult}}<span class="ayv-spine-room" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{/consult}}
        {{/out}}
    </a>
